# ==============================================================================
# Generic OpenVPN Client Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# To use free OpenVPN configs:
# 1. Download OpenVPN profile bundle (UDP 25000 / TCP 443) from:
#    https://www.vpnbook.com/freevpn/openvpn
# 2. Extract the archive and copy your desired .ovpn file to vpn/vpn.conf:
#    cp vpnbook-fr2311-udp25000.ovpn vpn/vpn.conf
# 3. Obtain current weekly password from https://www.vpnbook.com/freevpn/openvpn
#    and configure VPN_AUTH in your .env file.

client
dev tun
proto udp
remote vpn.example.com 1194
resolv-retry infinite
nobind
persist-key
persist-tun
remote-cert-tls server
cipher AES-256-GCM
auth SHA256
auth-user-pass
verb 3
